  "$comment": [
    "Controlled drug-class vocabulary for Sana (PRD §5.2, §5.3, §6.3).",
    "",
    "Class MEMBERSHIP is not authored here. Each class is defined by one or more",
    "WHO ATC code prefixes, and a drug belongs to it when RxClass reports that ATC",
    "code for the drug's ingredient. So membership is derived from an authoritative",
    "classification, not from anyone's judgement, and it is reproducible.",
    "",
    "The class list itself is driven by what §5.2 and §5.3 require the screening",
    "engine to reason about. Step 8 depends on these exact `id` strings."
  ],
